{pad:meta title='Store and reuse', about='push stores the primes without printing; pull and the store\'s own name read them back.'/}
{sequence:prime rows=6, push='primes'/}
<p>Stored: {pad:pull 'primes'}{$sequence} {/pad:pull}</p>
<p>Reversed: {pad:pull 'primes', reverse}{$sequence} {/pad:pull}</p>
<p>As a tag: {pull:primes}[{$primes}]{/pull:primes}</p>
<p>Term 8 of fibonacci, in an expression: {pad:echo sequence:fibonacci(8)/}</p>
